{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# gl(3) XXX, L = 2, adjoint x adjoint (64 states): how much of a state do multi-twist overlaps fix?\n\n**Question.** Companion frame. Let `|Psi(z)>` be the transfer-matrix eigenvectors at twist `z`, `<Om(w)|` the vacuum *left eigenvector* at an independent twist `w`, and `tau_a(y,u)` the transfer matrices at a third independent twist `y`, `a = 0,1,2` (`tau_0 = Id`). Suppose `<Om(w)| tau_a(y,u) |Psi(z)>` is known for all `w`, all `y`, all `u`, and `a = 0,1,2`. How constraining is\n\n```\n<Om(w)| tau_a(y,u) |v>  =  <Om(w)| tau_a(y,u) |Psi(z)>   for all w, y, u, a\n```\n\non `v`?\n\n**Reduction.** The equations are linear in `v`, so with\n\n```\nW  =  span{ <Om(w)| tau_a(y,u)  :  a in {0,1,2},  all w, y, u }   subset of  V*\n```\n\nthe solution set is `|Psi(z)> + W^perp`. Hence the entire answer is the single number\n\n```\ndim W^perp  =  64 - dim W\n```\n\nand it is the *same* for every one of the 64 states: only the right-hand side depends on `A`. So no eigenvector at twist `z` is ever needed -- the whole question is the **rank of the covector family**.\n\n**Making it finite.**\n\n- `tau_a(y,u)` is a polynomial of degree `2a` in `u`, so `2a+1` numeric `u`-points span the same operators as all `u`.\n- `tau_a(y,u)` depends on `y` only through the companion entries `(1, chi1, chi2, chi3)` and their `2x2` minors, so decomposing in `chi`-monomials gives a finite operator list.\n- `<Om(w)|` is an algebraic function of `w`, so sampling enough random `w` saturates its span; we check the rank plateaus.\n\n**Twists are fully general** here: `chi3 = det G` is *not* set to 1.\n\n## Conventions (ported from `rotations/su(3)-XXX-CG-adj-fund.wb`)\n\n- Lax `L_ij(u) = u d_ij - h E_ji`; monodromy `T_ij(u) = Sum_k L^(1)_ik(u-th1) L^(2)_kj(u-th2)`.\n- Companion twist `G = {{chi1,-chi2,chi3},{1,0,0},{0,1,0}}`, `det(t - G) = t^3 - chi1 t^2 + chi2 t - chi3`.\n- Quantum minors `qmin_{I,J}(u) = Sum_s sgn(s) Prod_k T_{I_s(k), J_k}(u - (k-1)h)`.\n- Cauchy-Binet: `tau_a(u) = Sum_{|I|=a} Sum_{|K|=a} qmin_{I,K}(u) det G_{K,I}`.\n- Chain point `th = (1/3, -8/57)`, `h = 1`, both sites `lam = {2,1,0}`. Exact rational arithmetic throughout.\n\nEverything below is numeric-exact (rationals); `u` and `w` are sampled, never carried symbolically.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 0. gl(N) generators in the Gelfand-Tsetlin basis. Ported verbatim from\n   rotations/su(3)-XXX-CG-adj-fund.wb (rank-independent). ---- *)\nClearAll[ps, dim, J0, Jp, Jm, JJ, v];\nps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[\n  {res = (Prepend[rep, #] & /@ (Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]))},\n  If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse @ Sort @ res, Reverse @ Sort @ Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[\n   Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}] /\n     Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]],\n   {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[\n   Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}] /\n     Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]],\n   {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[\n   k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n   l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n   l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n   l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep].JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep].JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n   l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep].JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep].JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];\nGrid[{{\"dim [2,1,0]\", dim[{2, 1, 0}]}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"773602\" data-output-id=\"34\" data-out-n=\"8\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"22\" data-sub-end=\"22\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[8]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcdGV4dHtkaW0gWzIsMSwwXX0gJiA4XFxcaGxpbmVcZW5ke2FycmF5fQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:1.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim [2,1,0]</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:1.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:1.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
