  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. Monodromy and untwisted quantum minors\n\nEverything is evaluated at **numeric rational** `u`. `qminM[I,J][y]` is a 64x64 exact rational sparse matrix; it is memoised because the same `y`-points are reused throughout.\n\nThe checks are the usual ones: the pseudovacuum `|Om_0> = |hw> (x) |hw>` (weight `{4,2,0}`) is annihilated by `T_ij` for `i > j` and has `T_ii |Om_0> = nu_i |Om_0>`, `qmin` is antisymmetric in its column set, and `qdet = nu1(u-2h) nu2(u-h) nu3(u)`. Antisymmetry in the columns is a genuine RTT consequence, so it confirms the shift direction matches this Lax convention.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 2. Monodromy T = L1(u-th1) L2(u-th2), L_ij(u) = u d_ij - h E_ji; quantum minors at numeric u. ---- *)\nClearAll[th1, th2, hh, Tmat, qminM, subsetsA, nu, ehw, hwIndex, kappa];\nth1 = 1/3; th2 = -8/57; hh = 1;\nsubsetsA[a_] := Subsets[Range[3], {a}];\nTmat[i_, j_][y_] := Tmat[i, j][y] = SparseArray @ Sum[\n   ((y - th1) KroneckerDelta[i, k] IdentityMatrix[dtot, SparseArray] - hh E1g[k, i]).\n    ((y - th2) KroneckerDelta[k, j] IdentityMatrix[dtot, SparseArray] - hh E2g[j, k]),\n   {k, 3}];\nqminM[II_List, JJl_List][y_] := qminM[II, JJl][y] = SparseArray @ Sum[\n   Signature[s] (Dot @@ Table[Tmat[II[[s[[k]]]], JJl[[k]]][y - (k - 1) hh], {k, Length[II]}]),\n   {s, Permutations[Range[Length[II]]]}];\n(* Yangian weights on the pseudovacuum *)\nnu[i_][y_] := (y - th1 - hh lam1[[i]]) (y - th2 - hh lam2[[i]]);\nhwIndex = First @ Flatten @ Position[Transpose[Table[Diagonal[Normal[Etot[i, i]]], {i, 3}]], lam1 + lam2];\nehw = UnitVector[dtot, hwIndex];\n(* vacuum eigenvalue factor of the UNTWISTED principal minor qmin_{I,I} *)\nkappa[II_List][y_] := kappa[II][y] = (qminM[II, II][y].ehw)[[hwIndex]];\nModule[{zero64 = ConstantArray[0, {dtot, dtot}], ys = {7/5, -3/2, 11/4, 2/9, -5/7}, chk},\n chk = {\n   {\"pseudovacuum index (weight {4,2,0})\", hwIndex},\n   {\"T_ii |Om0> = nu_i |Om0>\", And @@ Flatten @ Table[qminM[{i}, {i}][y].ehw === nu[i][y] ehw, {i, 3}, {y, ys}]},\n   {\"T_ij |Om0> = 0 for i > j\", And @@ Flatten @ Table[Normal[qminM[{i}, {j}][y].ehw] === ConstantArray[0, dtot], {i, 3}, {j, i - 1}, {y, ys}]},\n   {\"qmin_{I,J} antisym in J (|I|=2)\", And @@ Flatten @ Table[Normal[qminM[II, JJl][y] + qminM[II, Reverse[JJl]][y]] === zero64, {II, subsetsA[2]}, {JJl, subsetsA[2]}, {y, ys}]},\n   {\"qdet = nu1(u-2h) nu2(u-h) nu3(u) Id\", And @@ Table[Normal[qminM[{1, 2, 3}, {1, 2, 3}][y]] === nu[1][y - 2 hh] nu[2][y - hh] nu[3][y] IdentityMatrix[dtot], {y, ys}]},\n   {\"qmin_{I,I} |Om0> = kappa_I |Om0> (|I|=1,2,3)\", And @@ Flatten @ Table[qminM[II, II][y].ehw === kappa[II][y] ehw, {a, 3}, {II, subsetsA[a]}, {y, ys}]},\n   {\"kappa_{ij}(u) = nu_i(u-h) nu_j(u)\", And @@ Flatten @ Table[kappa[{i, j}][y] === nu[i][y - hh] nu[j][y], {i, 2}, {j, i + 1, 3}, {y, ys}]}\n   };\n Grid[chk, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"773602\" data-output-id=\"36\" data-out-n=\"27\" data-sub-idx=\"12\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"4\" data-sub-start=\"17\" data-sub-end=\"27\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[27]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:8.44em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pseudovacuum index (weight {4,2,0})</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T_ii |Om0&gt; = nu_i |Om0&gt;</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T_ij |Om0&gt; = 0 for i &gt; j</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">qmin_{I,J} antisym in J (|I|=2)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">qdet = nu1(u-2h) nu2(u-h) nu3(u) Id</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">qmin_{I,I} |Om0&gt; = kappa_I |Om0&gt; (|I|=1,2,3)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kappa_{ij}(u) = nu_i(u-h) nu_j(u)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[27]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{pseudovacuum index (weight \\{4,2,0\\})} & 1\\\\\\hline\\text{T\\_ii |Om0> = nu\\_i |Om0>} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{T\\_ij |Om0> = 0 for i > j} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{qmin\\_\\{I,J\\} antisym in J (|I|=2)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{qdet = nu1(u-2h) nu2(u-h) nu3(u) Id} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{qmin\\_\\{I,I\\} |Om0> = kappa\\_I |Om0> (|I|=1,2,3)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{kappa\\_\\{ij\\}(u) = nu\\_i(u-h) nu\\_j(u)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "aa3c3913-79da-42be-a267-88264d1066dc"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. Companion twist and the transfer matrices\n\n`G = {{chi1,-chi2,chi3},{1,0,0},{0,1,0}}` with `det(t - G) = t^3 - chi1 t^2 + chi2 t - chi3`, so `chi = (e1(w), e2(w), e3(w))` in terms of the twist eigenvalues `w`. **No unimodularity**: `chi3` is free.\n\n`tauM[a][chi][y] = Sum_{|I|=|K|=a} qminM[I,K][y] det G_{K,I}` (Cauchy-Binet for a constant twist).\n\nChecks: all `tau_a` coefficients commute; the companion spectrum equals the diagonal-twist spectrum with the same eigenvalues (so the two frames are related by conjugation, as they must be, and the *vacuum eigenvalue* can be read off in the diagonal frame); `tau_3 = chi3 nu1(u-2h) nu2(u-h) nu3(u)`; the spectrum is simple, i.e. 64 distinct states; and the companion twist genuinely breaks the Cartan, so there is no residual weight grading to hide behind.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 3. Companion twist; transfer matrices at numeric (chi, u); spectrum checks. ---- *)\nClearAll[Gsym, c1, c2, c3, minorGsym, tauM, tauDiagM, chiOf, vacEig];\nGsym = {{c1, -c2, c3}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\nminorGsym[K_List, JJl_List] := minorGsym[K, JJl] = Expand @ Det[Gsym[[K, JJl]]];\n(* companion transfer matrix at a numeric chi = {chi1,chi2,chi3} and numeric y *)\ntauM[a_][chi_List][y_] := tauM[a][chi][y] = SparseArray @ Sum[\n   (minorGsym[K, II] /. {c1 -> chi[[1]], c2 -> chi[[2]], c3 -> chi[[3]]}) qminM[II, K][y],\n   {II, subsetsA[a]}, {K, subsetsA[a]}];\n(* diagonal-twist transfer matrix with the same eigenvalues w, used only to identify the spectrum *)\ntauDiagM[a_][w_List][y_] := tauDiagM[a][w][y] = SparseArray @ Sum[(Times @@ w[[II]]) qminM[II, II][y], {II, subsetsA[a]}];\nchiOf[w_List] := {Total[w], w[[1]] w[[2]] + w[[1]] w[[3]] + w[[2]] w[[3]], Times @@ w};\n(* vacuum eigenvalue: qmin_{I,I} |Om0> = kappa_I |Om0>, so tau_a has vacuum eigenvalue Sum_{|I|=a} w_I kappa_I *)\nvacEig[a_][w_List][y_] := Sum[(Times @@ w[[II]]) kappa[II][y], {II, subsetsA[a]}];\n\nModule[{wT = {2, 3, 1/6}, chiT, ys = {7/5, -3/2, 11/4, 2/9, -5/7}, zero64 = ConstantArray[0, {dtot, dtot}], gen1, gen2, tt, cp1, cp2, res},\n chiT = chiOf[wT];\n gen1 = Sum[Prime[3 + 2 a + p] tauM[a][chiT][ys[[p]]], {a, 2}, {p, 5}];\n gen2 = Sum[Prime[3 + 2 a + p] tauDiagM[a][wT][ys[[p]]], {a, 2}, {p, 5}];\n cp1 = CharacteristicPolynomial[Normal[gen1], tt];\n cp2 = CharacteristicPolynomial[Normal[gen2], tt];\n res = {\n   {\"charpoly G\", Expand[Det[tt IdentityMatrix[3] - Gsym]]},\n   {\"[tau_a(y), tau_b(y')] = 0\", And @@ Flatten @ Table[Normal[tauM[a][chiT][y].tauM[b][chiT][y2] - tauM[b][chiT][y2].tauM[a][chiT][y]] === zero64, {a, 2}, {b, 2}, {y, ys[[1 ;; 3]]}, {y2, ys[[1 ;; 3]]}]},\n   {\"tau_3 = chi3 nu1(u-2h)nu2(u-h)nu3(u) Id\", And @@ Table[Normal[tauM[3][chiT][y]] === chiT[[3]] nu[1][y - 2 hh] nu[2][y - hh] nu[3][y] IdentityMatrix[dtot], {y, ys}]},\n   {\"companion spectrum = diagonal spectrum\", Expand[cp1 - cp2] === 0},\n   {\"simple spectrum (64 distinct states)\", Exponent[PolynomialGCD[cp1, D[cp1, tt]], tt] == 0},\n   {\"companion twist breaks the Cartan: [tau_1, E_11] != 0\", Normal[tauM[1][chiT][ys[[1]]].Etot[1, 1] - Etot[1, 1].tauM[1][chiT][ys[[1]]]] =!= zero64},\n   {\"vacEig is an eigenvalue of tau_a (diag frame)\", And @@ Flatten @ Table[tauDiagM[a][wT][y].ehw === vacEig[a][wT][y] ehw, {a, 2}, {y, ys}]}\n   };\n specCheckRes = res;\n Grid[res, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"773602\" data-output-id=\"37\" data-out-n=\"35\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"6\" data-sub-start=\"14\" data-sub-end=\"30\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[35]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:8.44em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">charpoly G</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">[tau_a(y), tau_b(y’)] = 0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tau_3 = chi3 nu1(u-2h)nu2(u-h)nu3(u) Id</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">companion spectrum = diagonal spectrum</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">simple spectrum (64 distinct states)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">companion twist breaks the Cartan: [tau_1, E_11] != 0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">vacEig is an eigenvalue of tau_a (diag frame)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">tt</span><span class=\"mord\">$299</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">tt</span><span class=\"mord\">$2992</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">tt</span><span class=\"mord\">$299</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[35]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{charpoly G} & -c1\\,tt\\$2992^2+c2\\,tt\\$2992-c3+tt\\$2992^3\\\\\\hline\\text{[tau\\_a(y), tau\\_b(y')] = 0} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{tau\\_3 = chi3 nu1(u-2h)nu2(u-h)nu3(u) Id} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{companion spectrum = diagonal spectrum} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{simple spectrum (64 distinct states)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{companion twist breaks the Cartan: [tau\\_1, E\\_11] != 0} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{vacEig is an eigenvalue of tau\\_a (diag frame)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "2ce3dfd7-83b2-41ef-9383-f9e62ebca936"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. The operator span over **all** `y` and **all** `u`, as a finite list\n\n`tau_a(y,u)` depends on `y` only polynomially through `chi`, and on `u` polynomially of degree `2a`. So\n\n```\nspan{ tau_a(y,u) : all y, all u }  =  span{ Op[a,m][y_p] }\n```\n\nwhere `Op[a,m][y] = Sum_{K,I} [chi^m](det G_{K,I}) qminM[I,K][y]` runs over the `chi`-monomials `m` occurring in the minors of `G`, and `y_p` is any set of `2a+1` distinct points. Both steps are verified below at random `chi` and random `u`, not assumed:\n\n1. `tau_a(chi,y) == Sum_m chi^m Op[a,m][y]` exactly;\n2. `tau_a(chi,u) == Sum_p Lagrange_p(u) tau_a(chi,y_p)` exactly.\n\nAdding `tau_0 = Id` gives the full operator list `opList`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 4. Finite spanning list for { tau_a(y,u) : all y, all u, a = 0,1,2 }. ---- *)\nClearAll[monoms, coeffKI, Op, uPts, opList, opTag, lagr, minRules];\nuPts[1] = {7/5, -3/2, 11/4};\nuPts[2] = {7/5, -3/2, 11/4, 2/9, -5/7};\n(* chi-monomial decomposition of the a x a minors of G (a companion matrix: its minors are linear in chi) *)\nminRules[K_List, JJl_List] := minRules[K, JJl] = Association[CoefficientRules[minorGsym[K, JJl], {c1, c2, c3}]];\nmonoms[a_] := monoms[a] = Union @ Flatten[Table[Keys[minRules[K, II]], {II, subsetsA[a]}, {K, subsetsA[a]}], 2];\ncoeffKI[m_, K_, II_] := Lookup[minRules[K, II], Key[m], 0];\nOp[a_, m_][y_] := Op[a, m][y] = SparseArray @ Sum[coeffKI[m, K, II] qminM[II, K][y], {II, subsetsA[a]}, {K, subsetsA[a]}];\nlagr[pts_, p_, x_] := Times @@ Table[(x - pts[[q]])/(pts[[p]] - pts[[q]]), {q, Complement[Range[Length[pts]], {p}]}];\n\nopList = Prepend[\n   Flatten[Table[{{a, m, y}, Op[a, m][y]}, {a, {1, 2}}, {m, monoms[a]}, {y, uPts[a]}], 2],\n   {{0, {0, 0, 0}, 0}, IdentityMatrix[dtot, SparseArray]}];\nopTag = First /@ opList;\n\nModule[{chiR = {13/7, -5/3, 9/4}, uR = 17/13, zero64 = ConstantArray[0, {dtot, dtot}], res},\n res = {\n   {\"chi-monomials for a=1 (exponents of c1,c2,c3)\", monoms[1]},\n   {\"chi-monomials for a=2\", monoms[2]},\n   {\"operator list length (incl. Id)\", Length[opList]},\n   {\"tau_a(chi,y) = Sum_m chi^m Op[a,m][y] (random chi, all y-points)\",\n    And @@ Flatten @ Table[\n      Normal[tauM[a][chiR][y] - Sum[(Times @@ (chiR^m)) Op[a, m][y], {m, monoms[a]}]] === zero64,\n      {a, {1, 2}}, {y, uPts[2]}]},\n   {\"tau_a(chi,u) = Sum_p Lagrange_p(u) tau_a(chi,y_p) (random u)\",\n    And @@ Table[\n      Normal[tauM[a][chiR][uR] - Sum[lagr[uPts[a], p, uR] tauM[a][chiR][uPts[a][[p]]], {p, Length[uPts[a]]}]] === zero64,\n      {a, {1, 2}}]}\n   };\n opCheckRes = res;\n Grid[res, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"773602\" data-output-id=\"38\" data-out-n=\"46\" data-sub-idx=\"12\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"8\" data-sub-start=\"16\" data-sub-end=\"31\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[46]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:13.2401em;vertical-align:-6.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:13.2001em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-6.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">chi-monomials for a=1 (exponents of c1,c2,c3)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">chi-monomials for a=2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.06em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">operator list length (incl. Id)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.14em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tau_a(chi,y) = Sum_m chi</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">m Op[a,m][y] (random chi, all y-points)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.34em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tau_a(chi,u) = Sum_p Lagrange_p(u) tau_a(chi,y_p) (random u)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:13.2001em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-6.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:4.800em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\