       "data": "Out[46]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{chi-monomials for a=1 (exponents of c1,c2,c3)} & \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 1\\\\0 & 1 & 0\\\\1 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{chi-monomials for a=2} & \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 1\\\\0 & 1 & 0\\\\1 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{operator list length (incl. Id)} & 33\\\\\\hline\\text{tau\\_a(chi,y) = Sum\\_m chi\\^{}m Op[a,m][y] (random chi, all y-points)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{tau\\_a(chi,u) = Sum\\_p Lagrange\\_p(u) tau\\_a(chi,y\\_p) (random u)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
