  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. The vacuum covector `<Om(w)|`\n\nNo diagonalisation is needed. The vacuum *eigenvalue* is known in closed form -- `qmin_{I,I}|Om_0> = kappa_I |Om_0>` with `kappa_i(u) = nu_i(u)`, `kappa_{ij}(u) = nu_i(u-h) nu_j(u)`, and the companion frame has the same spectrum as the diagonal one -- so\n\n```\ntau_a(w,u) has vacuum eigenvalue  eps_a(w,u) = Sum_{|I|=a} (Prod_{i in I} w_i) kappa_I(u)\n```\n\nand `<Om(w)|` is the **exact null vector** of the stacked `(tau_a(w,y_p) - eps_a(w,y_p))^T`. One rational linear solve per `w`, ~30 ms.\n\nChecked: the null space is one-dimensional at every sampled `w` (consistent with the simple spectrum); the resulting covector is a left eigenvector also at `u`-points *not* used in the construction; and covectors at different `w` are pairwise non-proportional -- different `w` really are different states.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 5. <Om(w)| as an exact null vector; sample a batch of random rational twists w. ---- *)\nClearAll[tauFromOps, omegaVec, wSamples, omegaSamples, nW];\ntauFromOps[a_][chi_List][y_] := Sum[(Times @@ (chi^m)) Op[a, m][y], {m, monoms[a]}];\nomegaVec[w_List] := Module[{chi = chiOf[w], stk},\n   stk = Join @@ Flatten[Table[\n      Transpose[Normal[tauFromOps[a][chi][y]] - vacEig[a][w][y] IdentityMatrix[dtot]],\n      {a, {1, 2}}, {y, uPts[a]}], 1];\n   NullSpace[stk]];\n\nnW = 80;\nSeedRandom[20260919];\nwSamples = Table[RandomSample[#, 3] &@RandomChoice[Range[-12, 12] /. 0 -> 13, 3] + {RandomInteger[{1, 5}]/RandomInteger[{2, 7}], RandomInteger[{1, 5}]/RandomInteger[{2, 7}], RandomInteger[{1, 5}]/RandomInteger[{2, 7}]}, {nW}];\nwSamples = DeleteDuplicates @ Select[wSamples, (Length[Union[#]] == 3 && FreeQ[#, 0]) &];\nnW = Length[wSamples];\nomegaSamples = Association @ Table[w -> omegaVec[w], {w, wSamples}];\n\nModule[{dims, extraU = {19/11, -23/9, 31/13}, eigOK, pairOK, oms},\n dims = Union[Length /@ Values[omegaSamples]];\n oms = First /@ Values[omegaSamples];\n (* left-eigenvector property at u-points NOT used in the construction *)\n eigOK = And @@ Flatten @ Table[\n    With[{om = First[omegaSamples[w]], chi = chiOf[w]},\n     om.Normal[tauFromOps[a][chi][y]] === vacEig[a][w][y] om],\n    {w, wSamples[[1 ;; Min[12, nW]]]}, {a, {1, 2}}, {y, extraU}];\n (* different w give non-proportional covectors *)\n pairOK = And @@ Flatten @ Table[MatrixRank[{oms[[i]], oms[[j]]}] == 2, {i, Min[15, nW]}, {j, i + 1, Min[15, nW]}];\n vacCheckRes = {\n   {\"number of distinct twists w sampled\", nW},\n   {\"dim of the null space (all w)\", dims},\n   {\"left eigenvector at 3 fresh u-points, 12 twists\", eigOK},\n   {\"<Om(w)| pairwise non-proportional (first 15)\", pairOK}\n   };\n Grid[vacCheckRes, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"773600\" data-output-id=\"15\" data-out-n=\"56\" data-sub-idx=\"10\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"10\" data-sub-start=\"16\" data-sub-end=\"32\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[56]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.84em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">number of distinct twists w sampled</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim of the null space (all w)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">left eigenvector at 3 fresh u-points, 12 twists</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;Om(w)| pairwise non-proportional (first 15)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">79</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[56]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{number of distinct twists w sampled} & 79\\\\\\hline\\text{dim of the null space (all w)} & \\left\\{1\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{left eigenvector at 3 fresh u-points, 12 twists} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{<Om(w)| pairwise non-proportional (first 15)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "8015d126-62b9-4cff-9c11-341416e75c6f"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5. The answer: `rank W`\n\nRows are `<Om(w)| Op` for every sampled `w` and every operator in `opList` (33 of them = `Id` + 4 `chi`-monomials x 3 `u`-points for `tau_1` + 4 x 5 for `tau_2`). Two things are reported:\n\n- the **saturation curve**, rank as a function of the number of twists `w` used -- it must plateau, or the sampling has not converged;\n- the **filtration**, how much each piece of the data (`Id` alone, `Id + tau_1`, `Id + tau_2`, everything) contributes, both per single `w` and globally.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 6. Rank of W = span{ <Om(w)| tau_a(y,u) }. Exact rational throughout. ---- *)\nClearAll[rowsFor];\nrowsFor[w_] := rowsFor[w] = With[{om = First[omegaSamples[w]]}, Table[om.Normal[opList[[k, 2]]], {k, Length[opList]}]];\naOf = opTag[[All, 1]];\nidIdx = Flatten@Position[aOf, 0];\na1Idx = Flatten@Position[aOf, 1];\na2Idx = Flatten@Position[aOf, 2];\nrkOf[idx_, k_] := MatrixRank[Join @@ Table[rowsFor[w][[idx]], {w, wSamples[[1 ;; k]]}]];\n\nsatCurve = Table[{k, rkOf[Range[Length[opList]], k]}, {k, {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 10, 15, 20, 30, 50, nW}}];\nrankW = Last[satCurve][[2]];\n\nGrid[Join[\n  {{\"SATURATION (rank vs number of twists w)\", Row[satCurve /. {k_Integer, r_Integer} :> Row[{k, \":\", r, \"  \"}]]}},\n  {{\"per-w rank: Id only\", Union@Table[MatrixRank[rowsFor[w][[idIdx]]], {w, wSamples[[1 ;; 20]]}]},\n   {\"per-w rank: Id + tau_1\", Union@Table[MatrixRank[rowsFor[w][[Join[idIdx, a1Idx]]]], {w, wSamples[[1 ;; 20]]}]},\n   {\"per-w rank: Id + tau_2\", Union@Table[MatrixRank[rowsFor[w][[Join[idIdx, a2Idx]]]], {w, wSamples[[1 ;; 20]]}]},\n   {\"per-w rank: all 33 operators\", Union@Table[MatrixRank[rowsFor[w]], {w, wSamples[[1 ;; 20]]}]},\n   {\"GLOBAL rank (all w): Id only\", rkOf[idIdx, nW]},\n   {\"GLOBAL rank (all w): Id + tau_1\", rkOf[Join[idIdx, a1Idx], nW]},\n   {\"GLOBAL rank (all w): Id + tau_2\", rkOf[Join[idIdx, a2Idx], nW]},\n   {Style[\"GLOBAL rank (all w): EVERYTHING = dim W\", Bold], Style[rankW, Bold]},\n   {Style[\"dim W^perp = 64 - dim W = undetermined directions in v\", Bold], Style[dtot - rankW, Bold]}}],\n Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"773600\" data-output-id=\"16\" data-out-n=\"66\" data-sub-idx=\"10\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"12\" data-sub-start=\"12\" data-sub-end=\"23\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[66]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:12.04em;vertical-align:-5.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:12em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-5.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SATURATION (rank vs number of twists w)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">per-w rank: Id only</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">per-w rank: Id + tau_1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">per-w rank: Id + tau_2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">per-w rank: all 33 operators</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GLOBAL rank (all w): Id only</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GLOBAL rank (all w): Id + tau_1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GLOBAL rank (all w): Id + tau_2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.19em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GLOBAL rank (all w): EVERYTHING = dim W</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:2.39em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim W</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">perp = 64 - dim W = undetermined directions in v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:12em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-5.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">27</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">45</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">54</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">61</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">63</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">63</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">63</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">63</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">63</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">63</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\">79</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">63</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">21</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">46</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">61</span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.19em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">63</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:2.39em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:12em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-5.75em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-13.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-14.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[66]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{SATURATION (rank vs number of twists w)} & 1\\text{:}9\\text{  }2\\text{:}18\\text{  }3\\text{:}27\\text{  }4\\text{:}36\\text{  }5\\text{:}45\\text{  }6\\text{:}54\\text{  }7\\text{:}61\\text{  }8\\text{:}63\\text{  }10\\text{:}63\\text{  }15\\text{:}63\\text{  }20\\text{:}63\\text{  }30\\text{:}63\\text{  }50\\text{:}63\\text{  }79\\text{:}63\\text{  }\\\\\\hline\\text{per-w rank: Id only} & \\left\\{1\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{per-w rank: Id + tau\\_1} & \\left\\{5\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{per-w rank: Id + tau\\_2} & \\left\\{7\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{per-w rank: all 33 operators} & \\left\\{9\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{GLOBAL rank (all w): Id only} & 21\\\\\\hline\\text{GLOBAL rank (all w): Id + tau\\_1} & 46\\\\\\hline\\text{GLOBAL rank (all w): Id + tau\\_2} & 61\\\\\\hline\\mathbf{\\text{GLOBAL rank (all w): EVERYTHING = dim W}} & \\mathbf{63}\\\\\\hline\\mathbf{\\text{dim W\\^{}perp = 64 - dim W = undetermined directions in v}} & \\mathbf{1}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "3381be32-f8f9-4455-bc55-95438d0cb920"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 6. What the one missing direction is\n\n`dim W = 63`, so `v` is fixed up to a **single** direction, the same one for every state. Below: compute it, identify it, and check it against data never used to build it.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 7. The missing direction: compute, identify, validate on fresh (w, y, u). ---- *)\nClearAll[nullVec, singletNS];\nnullBasis = NullSpace[Join @@ (rowsFor /@ wSamples)];\nnullVec = First[nullBasis];\n(* independent construction: the gl(3)-invariant vector in adj (x) adj *)\nsingletNS = NullSpace[Join @@ Flatten[\n    Table[If[i == j, Normal[Etot[i, i] - (Total[lam1] + Total[lam2])/3 IdentityMatrix[dtot]], Normal[Etot[i, j]]], {i, 3}, {j, 3}], 1]];\n\nSeedRandom[31415];\nfreshW = Table[RandomSample[Range[-9, 9] /. 0 -> 10, 3] + {1/3, 2/5, 5/7}, {8}];\nfreshChi = Table[{RandomInteger[{-9, 9}] + 1/3, RandomInteger[{-9, 9}] + 2/7, RandomInteger[{-9, 9}] + 4/9}, {5}];\nfreshU = {101/37, -57/23, 13/29, 200/11, -1/91};\nfreshSingle = And @@ Flatten@Table[\n   With[{om = First[omegaVec[w]]}, om.Normal[tauFromOps[a][ch][uu]].nullVec === 0],\n   {w, freshW}, {a, {1, 2}}, {ch, freshChi}, {uu, freshU}];\nfreshProd = And @@ Flatten@Table[\n   With[{om = First[omegaVec[w]]}, om.Normal[tauFromOps[a][ch][uu]].Normal[tauFromOps[b][ch2][uu2]].nullVec === 0],\n   {w, freshW[[1 ;; 3]]}, {a, {1, 2}}, {b, {1, 2}}, {ch, freshChi[[1 ;; 2]]}, {ch2, freshChi[[3 ;; 4]]}, {uu, freshU[[1 ;; 2]]}, {uu2, freshU[[3 ;; 4]]}];\n\nsOrbit = Table[Normal[opList[[k, 2]]].nullVec, {k, Length[opList]}];\nU0 = First /@ Values[omegaSamples];\n\nGrid[{\n  {\"dim W^perp\", Length[nullBasis]},\n  {\"weight of the null vector under Etot\", Union[Transpose[Table[Diagonal[Normal[Etot[i, i]]], {i, 3}]][[Flatten@Position[nullVec, x_ /; x =!= 0]]]]},\n  {\"E_ij . nullVec = 0 for all i != j\", And @@ Flatten@Table[If[i === j, True, Normal[Etot[i, j].nullVec] === ConstantArray[0, dtot]], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]},\n  {\"quadratic Casimir eigenvalue\", First[DeleteCases[Normal[Sum[Etot[i, j].Etot[j, i], {i, 3}, {j, 3}].nullVec]/nullVec, Indeterminate | ComplexInfinity]]},\n  {Style[\"nullVec IS the gl(3) singlet of adj (x) adj\", Bold], Style[Length[singletNS] == 1 && MatrixRank[{First[singletNS], nullVec}] == 1, Bold]},\n  {\"VALIDATION: <Om(w)|tau_a(y,u)|s> = 0 at 8 fresh w x 5 fresh y x 5 fresh u (400)\", freshSingle},\n  {Style[\"PRODUCTS tau_a(y,u) tau_b(y',u') do NOT annihilate |s>\", Bold], Style[! freshProd, Bold]},\n  {\"dim U0 = span{<Om(w)|} over all w\", MatrixRank[U0]},\n  {\"dim span{ tau_a(y,u)|s> } (single insertions, incl |s>)\", MatrixRank[sOrbit]},\n  {\"the whole orbit of |s> is orthogonal to the whole U0\", And @@ Flatten@Table[om.v === 0, {om, U0}, {v, sOrbit}]}\n }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
