  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 7. Independence of the chain point\n\nThe whole construction is rebuilt from scratch at a second inhomogeneity point (and a fresh set of `u`-points and twists) to check that `dim W = 63` and the identification of the null direction with the singlet are not accidents of `theta = (1/3, -8/57)`.\n\n**Trap:** this cell clears the memoised `Tmat`, `qminM`, `kappa`, `Op`, and resets `th1`, `th2`. After running it the kernel is at the *second* chain point. Re-run cells 5, 7, 9, 11, 13, 15 to return to the first.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 8. Rebuild at a second chain point and repeat the rank + identification. ---- *)\nrunAtTheta[t1_, t2_, uA_, uB_, nn_, seed_] := Module[\n   {wS, omS, rows, rk, ns, sg},\n   th1 = t1; th2 = t2;\n   ClearAll[Tmat, qminM, kappa, Op, tauM, tauDiagM, minRules, monoms];\n   Tmat[i_, j_][y_] := Tmat[i, j][y] = SparseArray @ Sum[\n      ((y - th1) KroneckerDelta[i, k] IdentityMatrix[dtot, SparseArray] - hh E1g[k, i]).\n       ((y - th2) KroneckerDelta[k, j] IdentityMatrix[dtot, SparseArray] - hh E2g[j, k]), {k, 3}];\n   qminM[II_List, JJl_List][y_] := qminM[II, JJl][y] = SparseArray @ Sum[\n      Signature[s] (Dot @@ Table[Tmat[II[[s[[k]]]], JJl[[k]]][y - (k - 1) hh], {k, Length[II]}]),\n      {s, Permutations[Range[Length[II]]]}];\n   kappa[II_List][y_] := kappa[II][y] = (qminM[II, II][y].ehw)[[hwIndex]];\n   minRules[K_List, JJl_List] := minRules[K, JJl] = Association[CoefficientRules[minorGsym[K, JJl], {c1, c2, c3}]];\n   monoms[a_] := monoms[a] = Union @ Flatten[Table[Keys[minRules[K, II]], {II, subsetsA[a]}, {K, subsetsA[a]}], 2];\n   Op[a_, m_][y_] := Op[a, m][y] = SparseArray @ Sum[coeffKI[m, K, II] qminM[II, K][y], {II, subsetsA[a]}, {K, subsetsA[a]}];\n   uPts[1] = uA; uPts[2] = uB;\n   SeedRandom[seed];\n   wS = DeleteDuplicates @ Select[\n      Table[RandomSample[Range[-11, 11] /. 0 -> 12, 3] + {RandomInteger[{1, 5}]/3, RandomInteger[{1, 5}]/4, RandomInteger[{1, 5}]/7}, {nn}],\n      (Length[Union[#]] == 3 && FreeQ[#, 0]) &];\n   omS = First /@ (omegaVec /@ wS);\n   rows = Join @@ Table[\n      Table[om.Normal[Op[a, m][y]], {a, {1, 2}}, {m, monoms[a]}, {y, uPts[a]}] // Flatten[#, 2] & // Prepend[#, om] &,\n      {om, omS}];\n   rk = MatrixRank[rows];\n   ns = NullSpace[rows];\n   sg = Length[ns] == 1 && MatrixRank[{First[ns], First[singletNS]}] == 1;\n   {Length[wS], rk, dtot - rk, sg}];\n\nthetaCheck = runAtTheta[1/5, 46/55, {3, -7/3, 5/9}, {3, -7/3, 5/9, 12/5, -1/8}, 30, 909090];\nGrid[{\n  {\"second chain point\", \"theta = (1/5, 46/55), fresh u-points, fresh twists\"},\n  {\"number of twists w\", thetaCheck[[1]]},\n  {\"dim W\", thetaCheck[[2]]},\n  {\"dim W^perp\", thetaCheck[[3]]},\n  {\"null direction = the same gl(3) singlet\", thetaCheck[[4]]}\n }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"773599\" data-output-id=\"9\" data-out-n=\"93\" data-sub-idx=\"3\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"16\" data-sub-start=\"30\" data-sub-end=\"36\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[93]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">second chain point</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">number of twists w</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim W</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim W</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">perp</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">null direction = the same gl(3) singlet</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">theta = (1/5, 46/55), fresh u-points, fresh twists</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">63</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[93]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{second chain point} & \\text{theta = (1/5, 46/55), fresh u-points, fresh twists}\\\\\\hline\\text{number of twists w} & 30\\\\\\hline\\text{dim W} & 63\\\\\\hline\\text{dim W\\^{}perp} & 1\\\\\\hline\\text{null direction = the same gl(3) singlet} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "c2e37939-62ac-4497-83a8-154eb22986c0"
