   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 8. Summary\n\n**`dim W = 63`, so `dim W^perp = 1`.** Knowing `<Om(w)| tau_a(y,u) |Psi(z)>` for all `w`, all `y`, all `u` and `a = 0,1,2` fixes `|Psi(z)>` up to exactly one direction:\n\n```\nv  =  |Psi(z)>  +  c |s>,      c in C  arbitrary\n```\n\nand `|s>` is the **gl(3)-invariant singlet of adj (x) adj** -- verified by an independent construction (`E_ij |s> = 0` for `i != j`, weight `{2,2,2}`, `C_2 = 12`, the singlet space is one-dimensional and matches). The ambiguity direction is the *same* for all 64 states and does not depend on `z`, on `theta`, or on anything else in the construction.\n\n**How the data builds up.** Per single twist `w` the 33 operators give only rank 9 (`Id` 1, `+tau_1` 5, `+tau_2` 7, all 9). Globally: `span{<Om(w)|}` alone is 21-dimensional; adding `tau_1` gives 46; `Id + tau_2` gives 61; everything gives 63, reached by 8 twists and flat thereafter (checked to 79). So varying `w` is doing most of the work, and `tau_2` is the more informative insertion.\n\n**Why the singlet is invisible.** The mechanism is a clean orthogonality of two subspaces:\n\n```\nU0    = span{ <Om(w)| : all w }                   dim 21\norb   = span{ tau_a(y,u)|s> : a, y, u }  (incl |s>) dim 13\nU0 . orb = 0   exactly, all 21 x 13 pairings\n```\n\nSo the entire single-insertion orbit of the singlet stays inside the 43-dimensional annihilator of the vacuum family.\n\n**This is a property of the linear span, not of the algebra.** Products `tau_a(y,u) tau_b(y',u')` do **not** annihilate `|s>` (checked at many random points). So one product insertion of two transfer matrices at different twists is enough to close the last direction and make the reconstruction complete. Note also `tau_3 = chi3 qdet` is a multiple of the identity, so it can never help.\n\n**Evidence.** Exact rational arithmetic throughout; no floating point, so no residuals to interpret -- the orthogonality relations are literal zeros. Validated against 400 `(w, y, u)` points never used to build the span, and the whole construction was rebuilt at a second chain point `theta = (1/5, 46/55)` with fresh `u`-points and fresh twists, giving the same 63 and the same singlet.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 9. General two-site version: any pair of gl(3) reps\n\nThe pipeline is repackaged as rep-generic functions, all keyed on `(lamA, lamB, thA, thB)` so that different rep pairs never share a cache. Only the genuinely rep-independent pieces are reused: `ps`/`dim`/`JJ` from cell 2, and `minorGsym`/`coeffKI`/`monoms`, which depend on the companion matrix `G` alone. Nothing here disturbs the `adj (x) adj` state above.\n\nTwo adjustments for the larger spaces:\n\n- `<Om(w)|` is the null space of a single **generic prime-weighted combination** of the `tau_a(w,y_p) - eps_a(w,y_p)` -- a `dt x dt` solve instead of `8 dt x dt`. The output is checked to be one-dimensional *and* a genuine left eigenvector at `u`-points outside the construction, so genericity is verified rather than assumed.\n- Rows are rescaled to primitive integer vectors and the saturation curve runs **modulo a large prime**. Since `rank mod p <= rank over Q`, a mod-`p` rank equal to `dt` *proves* full rank over `Q`; the final rank is recomputed exactly regardless.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 9a. Rep-generic chain builders, keyed on (lamA, lamB, thA, thB). ---- *)\nClearAll[prim, repDim, EAg, EBg, EtG, TmG, qmG, hwOf, kapG];\nprim[v_] := Module[{d, n}, If[AllTrue[v, # === 0 &], v, d = LCM @@ Denominator[v]; n = v d; n/(GCD @@ n)]];\nrepDim[lA_, lB_] := dim[lA] dim[lB];\nEAg[lA_, lB_][i_, j_] := EAg[lA, lB][i, j] = SparseArray @ KroneckerProduct[JJ[i, j, lA], IdentityMatrix[dim[lB]]];\nEBg[lA_, lB_][i_, j_] := EBg[lA, lB][i, j] = SparseArray @ KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[dim[lA]], JJ[i, j, lB]];\nEtG[lA_, lB_][i_, j_] := EAg[lA, lB][i, j] + EBg[lA, lB][i, j];\nTmG[lA_, lB_, tA_, tB_][i_, j_][y_] := TmG[lA, lB, tA, tB][i, j][y] = With[{d = repDim[lA, lB]},\n   SparseArray @ Sum[\n     ((y - tA) KroneckerDelta[i, k] IdentityMatrix[d, SparseArray] - hh EAg[lA, lB][k, i]).\n      ((y - tB) KroneckerDelta[k, j] IdentityMatrix[d, SparseArray] - hh EBg[lA, lB][j, k]), {k, 3}]];\nqmG[lA_, lB_, tA_, tB_][II_List, JJl_List][y_] := qmG[lA, lB, tA, tB][II, JJl][y] = SparseArray @ Sum[\n   Signature[s] (Dot @@ Table[TmG[lA, lB, tA, tB][II[[s[[k]]]], JJl[[k]]][y - (k - 1) hh], {k, Length[II]}]),\n   {s, Permutations[Range[Length[II]]]}];\nhwOf[lA_, lB_] := hwOf[lA, lB] = First @ Flatten @ Position[Transpose[Table[Diagonal[Normal[EtG[lA, lB][i, i]]], {i, 3}]], lA + lB];\nkapG[lA_, lB_, tA_, tB_][II_List][y_] := kapG[lA, lB, tA, tB][II][y] = With[{p = hwOf[lA, lB], d = repDim[lA, lB]},\n   (qmG[lA, lB, tA, tB][II, II][y].UnitVector[d, p])[[p]]];\nGrid[{{\"dim [2,1,0]\", dim[{2, 1, 0}]}, {\"dim [3,1,0]\", dim[{3, 1, 0}]}, {\"dim [3,1,0]^(x)2\", repDim[{3, 1, 0}, {3, 1, 0}]}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"773602\" data-output-id=\"39\" data-out-n=\"57\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"19\" data-sub-start=\"17\" data-sub-end=\"17\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[57]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcdGV4dHtkaW0gWzIsMSwwXX0gJiA4XFxcaGxpbmVcdGV4dHtkaW0gWzMsMSwwXX0gJiAxNVxcXGhsaW5lXHRleHR7ZGltIFszLDEsMF1cXnt9KHgpMn0gJiAyMjVcXFxobGluZVxlbmR7YXJyYXl9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.64em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim [2,1,0]</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim [3,1,0]</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim [3,1,0]</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">(x)2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">225</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[57]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{dim [2,1,0]} & 8\\\\\\hline\\text{dim [3,1,0]} & 15\\\\\\hline\\text{dim [3,1,0]\\^{}(x)2} & 225\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "1baf954e-fa4b-4056-9935-8089c9e8b2a3"
    }
