       "data": "Out[72]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{tag count} & 33\\\\\\hline\\text{generic-path <Om| is a left eigenvector at a fresh u} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
